<div class="xsto-container py-8 md:py-12 mr-discovery"><p class="mr-discovery-eyebrow">Here for the journey</p><header class="mb-8 max-w-3xl"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://mobilityrobot.co.uk"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Support","item":"https://mobilityrobot.co.uk/pages/support"}]}</script><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-4 text-xs text-muted-foreground"><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><a href="/" class="hover:text-gold">Home</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page" class="font-medium text-foreground">Support</span></li></ol></nav><h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-foreground md:text-4xl">Support that keeps you moving.</h1><p class="mt-3 text-lg text-muted-foreground">From the first question to everyday ownership, our UK team is here to help.</p></header><div class="mr-discovery-grid"><article class="mr-guide-card mr-support-card"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-package" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 21.73a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73z" /> <path d="M12 22V12" /> <polyline points="3.29 7 12 12 20.71 7" /> <path d="m7.5 4.27 9 5.15" /></svg><h2>Delivery</h2><p>Check delivery arrangements for your model and destination. Contact the team to confirm availability, timing and any setup requirements.</p><a href="/pages/delivery" class="mr-discovery-link">Delivery information <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10" /> <path d="M7 17 17 7" /></svg></a></article><article class="mr-guide-card mr-support-card"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z" /> <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4" /></svg><h2>Warranty</h2><p>Frame, electrical, mechanical and battery cover have different terms. Read the coverage and exclusions, or register your chair with the team.</p><a href="/pages/warranty" class="mr-discovery-link">Warranty and registration <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10" /> <path d="M7 17 17 7" /></svg></a></article><article class="mr-guide-card mr-support-card"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wrench" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.106-3.105c.32-.322.863-.22.983.218a6 6 0 0 1-8.259 7.057l-7.91 7.91a1 1 0 0 1-2.999-3l7.91-7.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.057-8.259c.438.12.54.662.219.984z" /></svg><h2>Accessories &amp; spares</h2><p>Choose accessories for your exact chair and configuration. Explore batteries, seating options, storage and control accessories.</p><a href="/collections/accessories" class="mr-discovery-link">Shop compatible accessories <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10" /> <path d="M7 17 17 7" /></svg></a></article><article class="mr-guide-card mr-support-card"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-undo-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 14 4 9l5-5" /> <path d="M4 9h10.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 5.5 5.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1-5.5 5.5H11" /></svg><h2>Returns &amp; aftercare</h2><p>Read the return conditions, including collection arrangements. For aftercare, have your model, serial number and order details ready.</p><a href="/pages/returns" class="mr-discovery-link">Returns information <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10" /> <path d="M7 17 17 7" /></svg></a></article><article class="mr-guide-card mr-support-card"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-question-mark" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" /> <path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3" /> <path d="M12 17h.01" /></svg><h2>Your questions</h2><p>Find answers about the XSTO range, ordering and ownership. Our buyer guides can also help you prepare for a demonstration.</p><a href="/pages/faq" class="mr-discovery-link">Frequently asked questions <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidde